   "text": "Over the wired link\n\nSSH  root@omy-SNPR44B1011.local (key login)\n  docker start/stop open_manipulator,\n  ros2 launch ..., shutdown, docker load\n\nROS 2 DDS - rmw_fastrtps_cpp - domain 30\n  /joint_states            robot -> AI   ~400 Hz\n  /leader/joint_trajectory -> follower ~300 Hz\n  /cameraN/.../compressed  cams -> AI    ~30 Hz",
